# This repo is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, so text is checked
# out as CRLF while the committed blobs are LF. Byte-level comparisons of
# generated files then report phantom drift (memo-android/tools/quality_gate.sh
# gate 5). Pin text to LF in the worktree as well so the two agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# cmd.exe parses these more reliably with CRLF (memo-android/gradlew.bat).
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
